":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e4734af98f631d4c2ffbe4e2ff32d5c6ea6c7235","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chrisshen12/FAGEL/commits/e4734af98f631d4c2ffbe4e2ff32d5c6ea6c7235","html_url":"https://github.com/Chrisshen12/FAGEL/commit/e4734af98f631d4c2ffbe4e2ff32d5c6ea6c7235"}],"stats":{"total":6,"additions":1,"deletions":5},"files":[{"sha":"2c5231e4cd6a47ac9679c690ed2e032315679bb8","filename":"README.md","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":5,"changes":6,"blob_url":"https://github.com/Chrisshen12/FAGEL/blob/02bdc6dc745a84bc7f947edaa98336adc2e63e28/README.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/Chrisshen12/FAGEL/raw/02bdc6dc745a84bc7f947edaa98336adc2e63e28/README.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chrisshen12/FAGEL/contents/README.md?ref=02bdc6dc745a84bc7f947edaa98336adc2e63e28","patch":"@@ -2,11 +2,7 @@\n \n This repository contains the official implementation of **FAGEL**, an efficient graph ensemble learning framework for large-scale graph learning.\n \n-> **Paper:** [Fast and Accurate Graph Ensemble Learning using Staged Training and Diversified Sampling](#)  \n-> **Authors:** Jiajun Shen, Yufei Jin, Xingquan Zhu\n-\n----\n-The camera-ready paper for ECML PKDD 2026 can be found at: \n+J. Shen, Y. Jin and X. Zhu, \"Fast and Accurate Graph Ensemble Learning using Staged Training and Diversified Sampling,\" *European Conference on Machine Learning and Knowledge Discovery in Databases (ECML PKDD)*, 2026.\n ## Overview\n \n Graph Neural Networks (GNNs) have become an effective approach for learning on large-scale graph data. However, conventional GNN ensemble methods require training multiple models independently, resulting in substantial computational and memory costs."}]}